LOCATION:Middle Eastern North African Cultural Center (MENA CC) Salon \, 305 crown st\, New Haven\, CT 06511-3491\, United States
URL:https://yaleconnect.yale.edu/rsvp?id=2326940
DESCRIPTION:Sundays\, 7 - 8 PM (when classes are in session)\n15 minutes teaching\n15 minutes discussion\n20 minutes guided meditation\nTaught by Sumi (Buddhist chaplain)\, unless otherwise noted\n\nTaking a pragmatic approach\, these sessions look at Buddhist teachings apply to our daily lives -- our everyday choices\, habits\, relationships\, how we move in the world. The aim is for you to walk out the door with \n---\nEvent Details: https://yaleconnect.yale.edu/rsvp?id=2326940
